      "conclusion_whnf": "HasFDerivAtFilter (fun s => D0.Analysis.MovingProjectorBookPrice.matrixBook03Price β z Δ P U s)\n  (ContinuousLinearMap.toSpanSingleton ℝ\n    (-(D0.Analysis.MovingProjectorBookPrice.matrixThermalState β (Δ t) *\n              (dΔ -\n                D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.comm (D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.generator (P t) dP)\n                  (Δ t))).trace.re +\n      z *\n        (2 *\n          ((1 -\n                      ↑z •\n                        (star (D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.cut (P t) (U t)) *\n                          D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.cut (P t) (U t)))⁻¹ *\n                  star (D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.cut (P t) (U t)) *\n                ((1 - P t) *\n                    (dU -\n                      D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.comm (D0.Algebra.MovingProjectorTransport.generator (P t) dP)\n                        (U t)) *\n                  P t)).trace.re)))\n  (nhds t ×ˢ pure t)",
